    "version": "1",
    "description": "We provide the experimental fit files, obtained with Pickett\u2019s SPFIT/SPCAT (32-bit version) programs with Kisiel\u2019s graphical interface AABS. PIFORM (version 31.XII.2016) was used for reformatting the fit output file. In all cases the Watson S reduction of the Hamiltonian in the Ir representation was employed. In case of iodobenzene, the data taken from O. Dorosh, E. Bia\u0142kowska-Jaworska, Z. Kisiel and L. Pszcz\u00f3\u0142kowski, J. Mol. Spectrosc., 2007, 246, 228\u2013232 DOI: 10.1016/j.jms.2007.09.010 was refitted, as the original fit uses the Watson A reduction in the Ir representation. Additionally, QDIAG version 1a.I.1998 outputs are provided. The nomenclature follows Fig. 1 of the main publication which is also attached (nomenclature.pdf). All files provided are in an ASCII format.",
